# talisman: the saved game the void session (DOS's golden) starts from. A new character, as
# the newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): one talisman left to destroy and Garamon buried
# (talisman_ok), a taper (0x93, a talisman: fate 10) into the pack, and the player moved to
# level 8, (31,30), on the walkway of the chamber at the centre of the level, facing north
# over its lava pit. Saved in slot I, described "talisman"
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat set talismans 1
44100 cheat set talisman_ok 1
44200 cheat give 0x93
44300 cheat goto 8 31 30
47000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "talisman"
47100 key s
47300 up ctrl
49000 key enter
50500 key t
50700 key a
50900 key l
51100 key i
51300 key s
51500 key m
51700 key a
51900 key n
53000 key enter
